WEBVTT

02:16.240 --> 02:17.079
Open it.

02:32.750 --> 02:33.630
Unshackle him.

02:34.240 --> 02:35.680
Your Majesty, but he...

02:36.750 --> 02:38.610
Could I possibly be afraid of him?

02:39.430 --> 02:40.290
Unshackle him.

02:56.870 --> 02:59.840
Li Shichang was struck down
by poison at court.

03:01.560 --> 03:03.800
I came to see how you are doing.

03:05.280 --> 03:07.010
Since you ascended the throne,

03:07.400 --> 03:09.200
he has opposed you at every turn.

03:09.430 --> 03:10.240
Now,

03:10.840 --> 03:12.300
he has met with such a fate.

03:12.400 --> 03:13.400
He deserves it.

03:16.280 --> 03:18.590
I heard Xiao Chi gave you the antidote.

03:18.800 --> 03:20.000
You seem

03:20.800 --> 03:22.400
to have made a good recovery.

03:23.030 --> 03:25.360
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty.

03:28.000 --> 03:29.120
This wine

03:29.870 --> 03:31.130
was brewed in the year,

03:31.360 --> 03:32.960
when Xiao Chi entered the pass,

03:32.960 --> 03:34.430
by the three of us.

03:37.590 --> 03:38.400
Have a sip.

03:39.240 --> 03:41.770
That's very thoughtful of you,
Your Majesty.

03:46.840 --> 03:47.560
Xiao...

03:47.560 --> 03:48.630
Where is Xiao Chi?

03:49.960 --> 03:51.400
Today, he

03:51.400 --> 03:53.329
might not have the luck to enjoy it.

03:54.000 --> 03:54.800
Right.

03:55.400 --> 03:56.460
I haven't told you.

03:57.870 --> 03:58.960
The Changmo army has already

03:58.960 --> 04:00.840
reached the gates of the capital.

04:03.630 --> 04:05.030
Your rescuers are here.

04:06.840 --> 04:08.150
How is it?

04:08.150 --> 04:10.150
Are you feeling

04:10.150 --> 04:11.750
very happy now?

04:12.080 --> 04:13.310
You see, once the Changmo army

04:13.310 --> 04:14.870
occupies Jinglan,

04:15.590 --> 04:16.850
should this top credit

04:17.310 --> 04:19.390
go to you, Lord Fei?

04:21.160 --> 04:21.950
Here.

04:22.560 --> 04:23.890
I propose a toast to you.

04:24.000 --> 04:26.870
To you, acting by my side
for so many years.

04:30.560 --> 04:31.870
It's been hard on you.

04:33.630 --> 04:35.270
I am a spy bought by Changmo.

04:38.270 --> 04:40.390
But my feelings for you and Xiao Chi

04:41.390 --> 04:42.830
have never been feigned.

04:46.750 --> 04:48.800
Telling me this at a time like this.

04:51.870 --> 04:52.680
Fine.

04:53.480 --> 04:54.720
I'd like to hear

04:55.120 --> 04:57.450
proof that your feelings are not feigned.

04:59.480 --> 05:00.480
When I was young,

05:01.360 --> 05:03.160
I was sold into the Changmo army.

05:03.830 --> 05:05.680
Because of my ruthlessness,

05:05.680 --> 05:06.810
I was chosen as a spy.

05:07.040 --> 05:08.270
During that time,

05:08.630 --> 05:10.690
more than 100 people died at my hands.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.190
I was just

05:12.190 --> 05:14.040
their best killing machine.

05:16.680 --> 05:18.390
Until I was sent to Jinglan

05:19.240 --> 05:20.830
and met you and Xiao Chi.

05:21.950 --> 05:23.070
During that time,

05:25.070 --> 05:27.040
I felt warmth for the first time.

05:28.270 --> 05:30.400
It was you who taught me how to be human.

05:30.870 --> 05:32.870
Fei Zheng, Fei Zheng.

05:41.120 --> 05:43.360
Fei Zheng, Fei Zheng.

05:45.430 --> 05:47.270
You really can act.

05:48.270 --> 05:50.070
Every word comes
from the bottom of my heart.

05:50.070 --> 05:51.800
Can you guarantee that for so many years,

05:51.800 --> 05:53.600
your feelings for Xiao Chi and me

05:54.510 --> 05:56.680
have all been genuine?

06:03.480 --> 06:05.240
I can prove it with my death.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.390
But if I'm here today

06:15.830 --> 06:17.070
just to kill you,

06:18.680 --> 06:19.800
are you afraid?

06:23.480 --> 06:24.360
I am,

06:25.830 --> 06:26.830
and I'm not.

06:28.800 --> 06:30.750
But I still want to thank you, Chu.

06:31.190 --> 06:32.159
Chu?

06:33.680 --> 06:35.240
I'm not here to catch up!

06:35.240 --> 06:37.190
I am here as a monarch

06:37.190 --> 06:38.750
to punish a spy!

06:39.800 --> 06:40.680
Fine.

06:43.240 --> 06:44.680
Then I

06:45.680 --> 06:47.270
thank you, Your Majesty.

06:54.070 --> 06:55.720
You wish to die?

06:59.240 --> 07:00.070
Fei Zheng,

07:00.630 --> 07:02.830
I promised Xiao Chi I wouldn't kill you.

07:03.070 --> 07:04.600
I'm telling you, Fei Zheng.

07:04.750 --> 07:06.190
I want you to stay in this prison

07:06.190 --> 07:08.920
and watch me conquer the world
with your own eyes.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.560
Watch closely.

07:24.190 --> 07:25.190
Your Majesty!

07:25.750 --> 07:28.210
When the Changmo army
breaches the capital,

07:28.830 --> 07:31.160
it will be too late for you to kill me.

07:39.159 --> 07:40.090
What did you say?

07:42.070 --> 07:43.070
I said

07:44.070 --> 07:46.530
when the Changmo army
breaches the capital,

07:46.750 --> 07:48.800
it will be too late for you to kill...

08:06.160 --> 08:07.190
Chu.

08:10.160 --> 08:11.000
It hurts.

08:12.750 --> 08:14.190
Please forgive

08:14.190 --> 08:15.630
my selfishness.

08:16.070 --> 08:17.310
In the future,

08:18.160 --> 08:20.070
I can no longer stay by your side.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.390
I...

08:22.680 --> 08:24.160
I have one more

08:24.680 --> 08:26.310
unreasonable request.

08:27.600 --> 08:29.430
After I die,

08:30.240 --> 08:31.040
bury me

08:31.750 --> 08:33.480
in that bamboo forest.

08:34.390 --> 08:35.909
When you have time,

08:36.840 --> 08:39.630
I hope you can go back and visit there.

08:40.440 --> 08:42.000
I wish you

08:42.440 --> 08:44.440
good health.

08:45.120 --> 08:48.480
May Jinglan be peaceful forever.

08:49.870 --> 08:50.960
Chu.

09:22.630 --> 09:23.720
I just

09:24.150 --> 09:26.030
personally killed Fei Zheng.

09:34.600 --> 09:36.260
You forced Liu Xie to her death

09:37.030 --> 09:38.240
and killed Fei Zheng.

09:39.000 --> 09:40.660
Who are you going to kill next?

09:42.080 --> 09:43.840
Who else do you have left?

09:44.480 --> 09:45.960
Xiao Chi fights for you,

09:46.480 --> 09:48.540
and Han Yunling treats your illness.

09:49.670 --> 09:51.080
They are useful to you.

09:51.630 --> 09:52.840
The next one

09:53.670 --> 09:54.840
will be me, right?

09:56.480 --> 09:58.010
What are you talking about?

09:58.600 --> 09:59.910
Your father has already brought his troops

09:59.910 --> 10:01.630
to the gates of the capital.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.480
Can't I even kill a spy

10:03.480 --> 10:05.670
he planted by my side for years?

10:05.670 --> 10:07.840
But he was as close as your own brother.

10:07.840 --> 10:10.240
So I don't trust anyone anymore!

10:16.270 --> 10:17.840
Princess Peace.

10:19.150 --> 10:21.000
Changmo and Jinglan

10:21.360 --> 10:23.030
maintain peace.

10:25.750 --> 10:27.080
It's truly ridiculous.

10:28.670 --> 10:30.080
Yes.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.270
The Changmo army

10:32.870 --> 10:35.390
has already reached the city gates.

10:36.600 --> 10:37.840
If you were me,

10:38.870 --> 10:40.080
what would you do?

10:41.870 --> 10:43.630
I never thought

10:43.870 --> 10:45.240
that one day,

10:45.550 --> 10:46.600
my husband

10:46.870 --> 10:48.440
and my father

10:48.440 --> 10:50.030
would fight to the death in front of me.

10:50.030 --> 10:51.750
But now, either your father or I

10:51.750 --> 10:53.080
must die!

10:53.550 --> 10:54.630
Who do you choose?

10:55.870 --> 10:58.000
If you die, I will not live alone.

11:04.670 --> 11:05.630
I used to...

11:09.840 --> 11:11.600
I used to love you so much.

11:12.030 --> 11:14.240
I was willing to give you everything.

11:16.200 --> 11:17.480
That was in the past.

11:19.440 --> 11:21.240
Now you only love yourself.

11:21.240 --> 11:23.200
I am the Emperor!

11:24.080 --> 11:26.550
I have to control the ministers!

11:27.600 --> 11:30.200
I have to make Jinglan prosper!

11:32.630 --> 11:34.600
It turns out hearts can change.

11:54.080 --> 11:55.030
Have...

11:57.870 --> 12:00.320
we decided on our child's name?

12:01.840 --> 12:03.870
Willow catkins scatter in the wind.

12:05.790 --> 12:07.750
Things remain, but people change.

12:10.480 --> 12:11.870
People have changed.

12:13.440 --> 12:15.480
Does this still matter?

12:39.240 --> 12:40.080
It's dawn.

12:40.510 --> 12:41.550
I should go.

12:44.440 --> 12:46.240
Do you have anything else to say?

12:54.550 --> 12:55.410
Come back soon.

13:02.790 --> 13:03.720
I'll try my best.

13:04.600 --> 13:05.400
Wait a minute.

13:16.360 --> 13:17.600
This is my treasure.

13:18.120 --> 13:19.250
When you're done...

13:33.150 --> 13:34.680
Remember to return it to me.

14:45.870 --> 14:48.130
I will be watching you from the city wall.

14:49.150 --> 14:50.750
I will definitely come back.

14:50.910 --> 14:51.480
Yeah.

15:50.240 --> 15:51.480
Xiao Chi!

15:51.480 --> 15:52.750
Your life belongs to me!

15:52.750 --> 15:54.270
You must come back alive!

15:56.720 --> 15:57.510
Hyah!

16:18.080 --> 16:19.270
Changmo is invading.

16:19.270 --> 16:20.800
We have nowhere to retreat.

16:20.960 --> 16:23.240
Behind us are our parents

16:23.240 --> 16:24.100
and loved ones.

16:24.630 --> 16:25.870
We absolutely can't retreat!

16:25.870 --> 16:28.270
-We absolutely can't retreat!
-We absolutely can't retreat!

16:28.270 --> 16:31.730
-We absolutely can't retreat!
-We absolutely can't retreat!

16:33.840 --> 16:35.030
Consort Ling,

16:35.150 --> 16:36.320
you can't go!

16:36.550 --> 16:37.670
Consort Ling!

16:57.960 --> 16:58.440
Master,

16:58.600 --> 16:59.530
why are you here?

16:59.670 --> 17:00.670
Don't overthink it.

17:00.670 --> 17:02.440
I was just afraid you'd lose my treasure

17:02.440 --> 17:04.040
and couldn't return it to me.

17:04.240 --> 17:05.569
Please be very careful.

17:05.920 --> 17:07.030
Destroy Jinglan,

17:07.550 --> 17:09.810
and we'll be the new masters of this land.

17:10.270 --> 17:11.310
Soldiers!

17:11.720 --> 17:12.960
Father!

17:16.550 --> 17:17.750
Father!

17:20.200 --> 17:21.310
Father!

17:25.069 --> 17:26.510
Father!

17:36.640 --> 17:38.200
Father!

17:54.110 --> 17:54.960
Father!

17:55.830 --> 17:57.490
Withdraw the troops, Father!

17:57.750 --> 17:58.960
Let's go home.

18:00.830 --> 18:02.920
I miss home.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.960
You promised me.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.720
Jinglan and Changmo

18:19.160 --> 18:20.720
would have peace,

18:20.720 --> 18:22.030
and the people would be safe.

18:22.030 --> 18:23.440
You said so!

18:25.440 --> 18:27.100
Withdraw the troops, Father.

18:29.720 --> 18:30.880
Father.

18:31.960 --> 18:33.480
Jinglan and Changmo

18:34.830 --> 18:36.510
already share a bond.

18:37.270 --> 18:39.510
We can't fight anymore.

18:41.880 --> 18:43.750
Father, I beg you.

18:44.240 --> 18:45.400
Father.

18:57.750 --> 18:58.920
All troops, charge!

18:58.920 --> 19:02.830
-Charge!
-Charge!

19:05.310 --> 19:06.480
-Charge!
-Charge!

19:12.750 --> 19:16.400
No! No!

20:00.680 --> 20:02.240
Physician Han,

20:02.880 --> 20:05.160
my child...

20:14.350 --> 20:16.200
My child...

20:28.440 --> 20:29.750
Wanyu!

20:30.680 --> 20:31.640
My child.

20:32.270 --> 20:33.240
Don't be afraid.

20:33.240 --> 20:33.920
I am here.

20:34.680 --> 20:35.590
I can't...

20:35.720 --> 20:37.030
It's too late.

20:51.680 --> 20:53.010
Protect the bloodline!

20:59.480 --> 21:00.590
You can do it.

21:01.440 --> 21:02.240
Push!

21:05.720 --> 21:06.720
Push!

22:00.750 --> 22:01.920
Push!

22:17.750 --> 22:20.410
You've knocked away all my wishes
when you fell.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.310
Then I wish you

22:22.310 --> 22:23.970
could find your beloved soon.

22:25.000 --> 22:27.310
Actually, I think I've found her.

22:30.720 --> 22:31.480
What am I

22:31.920 --> 22:33.920
to you now?

22:35.550 --> 22:36.790
My husband.

22:40.270 --> 22:43.110
I wish to trade my life for yours.

22:44.240 --> 22:45.720
I'm fine now.

22:46.920 --> 22:48.850
Are you going to pay with your life?

22:49.510 --> 22:50.960
I used to love you so much.

22:51.510 --> 22:53.750
I was willing to give you everything.

22:54.270 --> 22:55.880
You only love yourself.

23:10.240 --> 23:11.640
Get the child back for me!

23:20.160 --> 23:21.240
She's a girl.

23:23.350 --> 23:24.720
Take my child away.

23:25.510 --> 23:27.480
Don't let Liu Chu see her.

23:27.480 --> 23:28.720
I beg you.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.790
I only trust you.

23:30.790 --> 23:32.720
You must take her away.

23:48.270 --> 23:49.240
Yunling,

23:49.720 --> 23:51.250
take my child away quickly.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.200
Wanyu.

23:52.200 --> 23:53.600
Yunling, hurry up and go.

23:53.960 --> 23:54.920
General Xiao.

23:55.350 --> 23:57.750
General Xiao, I'm counting on you.

23:57.750 --> 23:58.830
Hurry, go.

23:58.830 --> 23:59.890
What should you do?

24:00.310 --> 24:01.570
Don't bother about me.

24:53.000 --> 24:56.030
Xiao Chi!

24:56.030 --> 24:57.750
Kill!

26:29.750 --> 26:30.750
Your Majesty!

26:32.310 --> 26:33.880
I have held the city gates!

26:37.350 --> 26:38.830
Please, Your Majesty,

26:39.240 --> 26:40.830
release Zheng!

27:34.750 --> 27:35.750
You will

27:37.680 --> 27:39.440
never see my child again.

27:42.920 --> 27:43.920
I wish you

27:44.720 --> 27:45.550
a long

27:46.830 --> 27:48.070
and healthy life.

29:05.680 --> 29:06.680
Your Majesty,

29:07.270 --> 29:09.800
we failed to find the baby
on the battlefield.

29:10.160 --> 29:11.440
It was so chaotic.

29:11.720 --> 29:12.960
Even if the baby had been born,

29:12.960 --> 29:14.070
it probably

29:14.350 --> 29:15.750
couldn't have survived.

29:16.270 --> 29:17.310
Where is

29:19.110 --> 29:20.680
Han Yunling?

29:22.440 --> 29:23.750
Wasn't she

29:25.510 --> 29:27.830
with the Noble Consort till the end?

29:27.960 --> 29:30.750
We've searched
inside and outside the city,

29:30.750 --> 29:32.280
but there's no trace of her.

29:35.240 --> 29:36.590
Bury

29:37.510 --> 29:39.570
all the surrendered soldiers alive.

29:39.750 --> 29:40.240
But...

29:40.550 --> 29:42.810
that's hundreds of thousands of people.

29:43.440 --> 29:44.480
Kill them.

29:46.070 --> 29:47.110
Yes.

30:52.830 --> 30:53.790
Aunt,

30:53.880 --> 30:56.590
why do we come here

30:56.590 --> 30:58.240
on this day every year?

31:01.030 --> 31:02.680
Because from here, we can see

31:02.680 --> 31:03.960
Jinglan in the east.

31:04.350 --> 31:06.070
Why do we see Jinglan?

31:08.030 --> 31:08.960
Because...

31:11.510 --> 31:13.310
the people who love us are there.

31:17.400 --> 31:18.350
Aunt,

31:18.350 --> 31:20.110
I want candied hawthorn.

31:20.830 --> 31:22.960
The candied hawthorn stall isn't open yet.

31:22.960 --> 31:25.220
After I finish treating the new general,

31:25.440 --> 31:26.350
I'll buy you candied hawthorn,

31:26.350 --> 31:26.960
okay?

31:27.200 --> 31:27.680
Be good.

31:27.680 --> 31:28.240
Okay.

31:56.110 --> 31:57.110
Yue.

31:57.350 --> 31:58.350
Don't touch that.

31:58.480 --> 32:00.350
It belongs to someone else.

32:27.200 --> 32:28.920
I'm back.
